{"id":"n16414-2-8","stage":3,"title":"가로막다 · 阻止","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16414-2-8-1","ko":"왜 자꾸 내 말을 가로막는 겁니까?","zh":"为什么总是打断我说话？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자꾸","meaning":"一直，总是","explanation":"자꾸：一直，总是","readings":[{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70796","senseId":"1","lemma":"자꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말을","meaning":"话","explanation":"말：话；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"6","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가로막는","meaning":"阻止，阻挡，拦","explanation":"가로막다：阻止，阻挡，拦；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"가로막다","audio":"/audio/6c608fff72de623716ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16414","senseId":"2","lemma":"가로막다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"겁니까?","meaning":"那个","explanation":"거：那个；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㅂ니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66342","senseId":"2","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"d28ff63a0382ce4f","term":"자꾸","zh":"一直，总是","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3","entryId":"70796","definition":"多次连续地。","pronunciation":["자꾸"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"话","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"符合逻辑或合乎道理的言语。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"6c608fff72de6237","term":"가로막다","zh":"阻止，阻挡，拦","audio":"/audio/6c608fff72de623716ed.mp3","entryId":"16414","definition":"妨碍别人说话、行动或做事。","pronunciation":["가로막따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"66342","definition":"指代前面已经讲过的对象。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/d499f05618b0dd163705.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n16414-2-8-2","ko":"당신이 말도 안 되는 소리를 하고 있잖아요.","zh":"您在说些毫无道理的废话啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"당신이","meaning":"您","explanation":"당신：您；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"당신","audio":"/audio/348eb0b3d01dfc542003.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30200","senseId":"5","lemma":"당신","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말도","meaning":"话","explanation":"말：话；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"6","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되는","meaning":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","explanation":"되다：某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"20","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"소리를","meaning":"话，语言","explanation":"소리：话，语言；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"소리","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62379","senseId":"2","lemma":"소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하고","meaning":"说（소리를 하다：说出话来）","explanation":"하다：说（소리를 하다：说出话来）；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"28","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있잖아요.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；잖아요：礼貌地提醒对方已知的事实：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"348eb0b3d01dfc54","term":"당신","zh":"您","audio":"/audio/348eb0b3d01dfc542003.mp3","entryId":"30200","definition":"(敬语)指代听话人。","pronunciation":["당신"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"话","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"符合逻辑或合乎道理的言语。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"d13cec79f66edb6a","term":"소리","zh":"话，语言","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3","entryId":"62379","definition":"为传达想法或感受而用嗓音表现出来的方式。","pronunciation":["소리"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"说（소리를 하다：说出话来）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"说（소리를 하다：说出话来）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/4c74986e3c4df9208de4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.777,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=16414","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":97,"sequenceScore":2.6037,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["您在说些毫无道理的废话啊。","为什么总是打断我说话？","你昨天不是说丢了钱包吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["为什么总是打断我说话？","你昨天不是说丢了钱包吗？","您在说些毫无道理的废话啊。"],"answer":2}]}
